# Home Finance OS (HFOS)

## Changelog

All notable changes to Home Finance OS are documented in this file.

This project follows a sprint-based development process.

---

# v0.2.0 — Application Shell Complete

**Status**

Development Milestone

**Completed**

- Application Shell
- Sidebar Navigation
- Context Header
- TimeContext component
- Shared Brand component
- React Router foundation
- Shared UI Components
- Governance Module
- Document Registry
- Markdown Viewer
- Approval Card
- Status Badge

**Architecture**

- Feature-first architecture
- Shared component library
- Shared branding
- Centralized routing
- Reusable layouts

**UX Improvements**

- Sidebar provides navigation
- Header provides context
- Pages focus on user tasks
- Duplicate page titles removed
- Cleaner visual hierarchy

